/c__nediz_by_minnoux_daqqwyi-fullview.jpg?token=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJ1cm46YXBwOiIsImlzcyI6InVybjphcHA6Iiwib2JqIjpbW3siaGVpZ2h0IjoiPD0xNDUzIiwicGF0aCI6IlwvZlwvOWQ3NTg5ZGQtZDhjOC00NjA4LTk4ZGItNDRiYWMyNTQwZmJkXC9kYXFxd3lpLWQ3YzNkZjRhLWE3NmEtNDNlZC05MDJkLWFkMTQxY2I0MzkxZC5wbmciLCJ3aWR0aCI6Ijw9MTAyNCJ9XV0sImF1ZCI6WyJ1cm46c2VydmljZTppbWFnZS5vcGVyYXRpb25zIl19.qO_qGDqKFKLmPFDM5cOyfY9KX2ByuBiOPFIqVyy66RQ\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Nimue comes from a land beyond our world. He disdains the fashions and habits of the Raksha and claims to be a Nafanshae- a being of the <i>Obsidian Mirror World</i>. Whatever that may be, he comes to our world to travel, enjoy our strange habits and hear new songs. Nimue says that hearing our music prevents him from transforming into a cloud of pearlescent fire, which he promises to be, &quot;Similar to that death thing you have, but less pleasant.&quot; He is mercurial, easily entertained and spends extravagantly on clothing in the newest Realm styles, though it's impossible to tell from what source his wealth comes. Nimue has access to a strange form of magic that allows him to borrow the voices of others; and, by doing so can channel their powers. The Nafanshae is currently looking for a silver mirror that is strong enough to survive the journey to his homeland. With it, he hopes to conquer what his people face instead of hunger.<br /> <br /> He is also capable of, for whatever reason, transforming into a giant horned carp. He prefers not to do so.<br /> <br /> I want to see a character who is old.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4578,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4578-zale","user":"Zale","date":".  Added my request. 02-10-2021, 05:34 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4578-zale","name":"Zale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4578_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"156"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-13T20:10:23-08:00","id":1435417,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Zale</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1434562-i-want-to-see-a-character-who?p=1435054#post1435054\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I want to see a character who is old.</div> </div> </div> </div><div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <img src=\"https://i.pinimg.com/564x/3d/13/0e/3d130e204d85b521e1f9d20f04be8c26.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> </div></div> </div> </div> <br /> Melpomene is an automaton from an age long dead, now a lonesome quester in the ruined cities of the South. He carries two swords of black glass which whine quietly and can cut with great ease and sharpness. He is a forlorn and beautiful creature, skilled in archaic forms of poetry and dance as well as a queer, haunting music he can play by worrying the edges of his swords against one another. A sort of caravan of fellow wanderers has sprung up around Melpomene, following him on his travails through the deserts and badlands. Though he has no need for food or water, the whine of Melpomene's swords intensifies when water is near, and so his train make their business as prospectors.<br /> <br /> Melpomene speaks in an ancient and impeccably polite language that pleases the gods and living spirits of the world, but its utterly incomprehensible to humanfolk. If he could ever find a human who could understand him, there are surely many stories he could tell of the things he has seen and the places he has been.<br /> <br /> I want to see a character who likes books!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11619-kymmetheseventh","name":"KymmetheSeventh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11619_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"151"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-14T08:28:52-08:00","id":1435456,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KymmetheSeventh</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1434562-i-want-to-see-a-character-who?p=1435417#post1435417\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I want to see a character who likes books!</div> </div> </div> </div><div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.zerochan.net/240/41/19/1508491.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Robin Vaara is a Lookshyian helot loved stories in all it's forms. Whether historical or fictional, mythological or contemporary, and whatever culture she will do everything in her power to read such stories. For they are a gate way to wonderful worlds and grand ideals. Due to her desire for stories Robin spent her life learning languages one after another. She knew over five major languages by the time she was 18. Her prodigious nature with a pen brought her attention from the General Staff and made her a natural pick as a propagandist for the Seventh Legion.<br /> <br /> By the chance of fate she found an ancient text made of orichalcum and written in the Old Realm. Her curiosity boundless she spent two years learning the ancient tongue of Old Realm and find a fantastic and subversive story of a heroic group of anathema and their allies battling the enemy of the gods. She thought only one thing.<br /> <br /> *This story deserves to be told*<br /> <br /> And for that she exalted as one of the Deceivers... but that was not what the ancient text called them.<br /> -----------<br /> I want to see a character that is funny.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14713-chronos12","name":"Chronos12","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14713_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"56"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}